{"2902640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghost Hunter", "steam_appid": 2902640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Embark on an ethereal journey in Ghost Hunter, where the thrill of the hunt meets the challenge of the unknown. Equip yourself for spectral encounters and customize your character to reflect your own ghost-hunting style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Ghost Hunter</h2>Craft your own ghost hunting outfit from the several avaliable options, mix and match until you have your perfect style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/14a0f993d4f15299d0ea7ed4a976ce81.poster.avif?t=1714398201\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/14a0f993d4f15299d0ea7ed4a976ce81.webm?t=1714398201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/14a0f993d4f15299d0ea7ed4a976ce81.mp4?t=1714398201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage with the Eerie </h2>Navigate through chilling environments, each haunted by its own set of unique spirits. Capture them and use their power to your benefit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/6fbf16be8cfe2395344e044a43fccff4.poster.avif?t=1714398201\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/6fbf16be8cfe2395344e044a43fccff4.webm?t=1714398201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902640/extras/6fbf16be8cfe2395344e044a43fccff4.mp4?t=1714398201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><